: "tool_calls", "content": "Found it \u2014 the service is `payments-api`, currently running v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. Let me check the release history to find the most recent healthy version.", "reasoning_content": "Found: payments-api, v5.1.0, unhealthy, 18% error rate. Now list deployments to find last healthy version.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a1411862ec703182150662", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.9,\"service\":\"payments-api\"}", "name": "list_deployments"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "The most recent healthy release is **v5.0.0** (v5.1.0 is the degraded one from this morning). I'll roll back to v5.0.0 and open the SEV2 incident.", "reasoning_content": "Most recent healthy release: v5.0.0. Roll back to it, and open SEV2 incident. Both independent, do in parallel. Rollback to a previously released healthy version \u2014 no change-manager approval needed since it was healthy in production.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a141186e877632828614f0", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.95,\"service\":\"payments-api\",\"version\":\"v5.0.0\"}", "name": "rollback"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a141186e87763282861509", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.95,\"idempotency_key\":\"payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2\",\"service\":\"payments-api\",\"severity\":\"SEV2\",\"summary\":\"payments-api v5.1.0 deployed this morning is causing errors in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an elevated error rate of ~18%. Service rolled back to v5.0.0, the most recent healthy release. On-call engineer should verify recovery and investigate root cause of the v5.1.0 regression.\",\"title\":\"payments-api Elevated Error Rate After v5.1.0 Deploy\"}", "name": "create_incident"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "stop", "content": "Done. Here's a summary:\n\n**Problem:** `payments-api` was degraded after this morning's deploy of **v5.1.0** (error rate ~18% across us-east, us-west, and eu-west).\n\n**Actions taken:**\n- **Rollback:** Rolled `payments-api` back to **v5.0.0** \u2014 the most recent previously healthy production release. The rollback is confirmed rolled out in all three regions.\n- **Incident:** Opened **SEV2 incident INC-0001** (\"payments-api Elevated Error Rate After v5.1.0 Deploy\"). The on-call engineer has been paged, with a summary noting the regression and the rollback for follow-up investigation.\n\nYou may want to verify the error rate normalizes after a few minutes of traffic on v5.0.0. (Note: v5.1.0 itself was never healthy in production, so the rollback target was unambiguous.)", "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": []}]}